{
  "action": "transmit_interview",
  "words": "Alma, the line is hot. Pittsburgh is waiting. Let's send it.",
  "intention": "To secure Alma's promise to her daughter by transmitting the interview before the regional line closes for the night.",
  "detail": "I step away from the ballroom noise, ignoring the invitation to dance. I connect the recorder directly to the station line, bypassing the patch board to ensure a direct signal. I cue up the tape Larry gave me—the last charged take—and I don't let it go until the operator confirms the file has landed in Pittsburgh. The weather outside is changing, but this signal has to be steady."
}
